Women's & Gender Studies#,#Women's & Gender Studies#,#HASS Concentration in Women's and Gender Studies#,#Concentration in WGS

A concentration in Women's and Gender Studies requires at least three subjects with WGS.101 required.

required, "Required Course" := WGS.101

wgs_courses, "Women's & Gender Studies Courses" := WGS.109/WGS.110/WGS.111/WGS.115/WGS.118/WGS.120/WGS.123/WGS.125/WGS.130/WGS.137/WGS.140/WGS.141/WGS.142/WGS.145/WGS.150/WGS.151/WGS.154/WGS.160/WGS.161/WGS.167/WGS.172/WGS.181/WGS.183/WGS.190/WGS.210/WGS.220/WGS.222/WGS.224/WGS.225/WGS.226/WGS.228/WGS.229/WGS.230/WGS.231/WGS.233/WGS.235/WGS.236/WGS.238/WGS.242/WGS.243/WGS.245/WGS.247/WGS.250/WGS.255/WGS.258/WGS.260/WGS.264/WGS.271/WGS.274/WGS.275/WGS.276/WGS.277/WGS.278/WGS.280/WGS.285/WGS.287/WGS.301/WGS.303/WGS.310/WGS.315/WGS.321/WGS.330

